process in almost all instances leads to increase in size (length, weight, and
volume) and actively progresses from the fertilization of the ovum to the
period of<DISEASE_DISORDER> sexual maturity</DISEASE_DISORDER> where millions<DETAILED_DESCRIPTION> of cells</DETAILED_DESCRIPTION> are present in a state of
